{
	"id": 73529,
	"type": "WQ",
	"name": "銳意與優雅的戰舞？",
	"description": "#在「隱眾遊園」的關鍵區，某位言行奇詭的「輕劍舞者」像是從{F#妳}{M#你}們的身上感應到了某種重要的事物…",
	"unlockDescription": "",
	"chapter": "",
	"showType": "QUEST_SHOW",
	"activityId": 2023,
	"mainQuestTag": "MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE",
	"suggestTrackMainQuestList": [],
